  "description": "Crash matrix: one meta-transaction over pg and graph (two-phase) and clickhouse (one-phase, applied after the decision), journal required. The process dies (a BaseException, nothing is caught or rolled back) at crash_at, then one recovery run happens after stale_after_ms with every fault healed. after_crash is the state the crash leaves; after_recovery must be all-or-nothing.",
