      "two_phase": true
    }
  ],
  "fault_points": "<store>.stage | <store>.prepare[.after] | <store>.finish[.after] | journal.<STATE>[.after]: the crash happens when the coordinator is about to call (or has just returned from) that step; journal.ACTIVE is the record's creation, journal.<STATE> a compare-and-set into STATE. The coordinator finishes each branch once (no in-process retries). trace and recovery_trace list the steps reached, in order (the step that crashed included, .after points omitted): lock-free branches stage first, lock holders prepare last and finish first.",
